{"articleNo":"501240","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=501240&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2024년도 통영시 저소득 대학생 장학금 지원대상자 선발 관련 안내(기간연장)","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2024.11.01","hit":"9040","attachments":[{"name":"2024년도 통영시 저소득 대학생 장학금 지원대상자 선발 공고.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=501240&attachNo=138356"},{"name":"2024년도 통영시 저소득 대학생 장학금 지급 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=501240&attachNo=138357"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">□ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">년도 통영시 저소득 대학생 장학금 지원대상자 선발 개요</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- 선발예정인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 00</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">지원금액</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">인당 상한액 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">만&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><u style=\"text-indent: -50pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">※ </span></u><u style=\"text-indent: -50pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">지원인원 및 지원액은 예산 범위 내에서 조정 가능</span></u></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">- 지원자격:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">국민기초생활 보장법</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">에 따른 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">기초생활수급자 및 차상위 계층 대학생</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">으로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -43.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">학업성적 평균 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -43.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">C</span><span style=\"text-indent: -43.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">학점 이상</span><span style=\"text-indent: -43.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">을 취득하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -43.5pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -55pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -55pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">관내 고등학교 졸업자</span><span style=\"text-indent: -55pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">로&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -55pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">공고일 현재 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -55pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">주민등록상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -55pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">6</span><span style=\"text-indent: -55pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">년 이상 통영시에 주소를 두고&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -46.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">통영시 관내 학교를 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -46.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">6</span><span style=\"text-indent: -46.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">년 이상 다닌 자</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><table style=\"border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 1164px; height: 29px; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border-width: 0.28pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"1\"><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">제외대상</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"width:433.84pt;height:54.57pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.28pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:115%;margin-left:77.0pt;text-indent:-45.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">통영시 저소득 대학생 장학금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">회 이상 수혜자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:115%;margin-left:77.0pt;text-indent:-45.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- 2024</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">년도 통영시 성적우수 장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">지역대학생 장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">인재육성장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">예체능 분야</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수혜자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:115%;margin-left:77.0pt;text-indent:-45.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">등록금이 아닌 생활비 성격의 장학금 수혜자 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:115%;margin-left:77.0pt;text-indent:-45.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">대학원생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">휴학생</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- 선발기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">학업성적이 평균 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">C</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">학점 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(2024</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">학기 성적 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span><div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">지원신청</span><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- 신청기간</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; (기존) 2024. 11. 1.(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)~11. 20.(수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; (변경) 2024. 11. 1.(금)~11. 27.(수)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- 신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">방문 또는 우편접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">제출처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">통영시 평생학습관 평생학습팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></